    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Communism has a 100% track record of failure.\n\nIt loses its best people.\n\nNY City better brace for impact.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2044214230375628852",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-15T00:40:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "What\u2019s more likely to happen?",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2044118868449214507",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-14T18:21:30+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If you eliminate fear of the future and resentment of the past, you\u2019ll be shocked how peaceful life becomes.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2044052302722437483",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-14T13:57:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The goal is simple.  \n\nBeat your prior best in everything you do.  \n\nIn business \nIn health \nIn parenting \nIn marriage \nIn decision making \nIn your spiritual walk\n\nAs long as you continue to improve daily, eventually the efforts will compound.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2043522719967297566",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-13T02:52:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Capitalism works so well that even its socialist like @BernieSanders became a millionaire.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2043479906906943767",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-13T00:02:30+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Mark my word!\n\n2028 presidential race will break every rule in politics.\n\nAn open battlefield w/out Trump in it.\n\nStrange people will be running.\n\nHollywood stars\nInfluencers\nPodcasters\nFormer athletes\nPastors\n\nI have a list of 22 outsiders that could be running.\n\nIt\u2019ll be nasty!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2043035318404751671",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T18:35:52+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Death penalty is not enough.  \n\nMutilation?\nCastration?\nThen public execution.  \n\nYou have to make a public example of this evil behavior or else it\u2019ll continue.\n\n\nBreanna Morello (@BreannaMorello)\n\n\ud83d\udea8HORRIFYING\ud83d\udea8\n\nJurors will listen to the audio of 7-year-old Athena Strand being strangled to death by FedEx driver Tanner Horner.\n\nHorner pleaded guilty to capital murder, but a juror will decide if he should be sentenced to death. \n\nStrand told the child, \u201cDon't scream or I'll hurt you,\u201d as he picke",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2042354010221420816",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-09T21:28:35+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "At least it\u2019s better than what America got trading Brittney Griner for Viktor Bout.\n\n\nESPN (@espn)\n\nBreaking: Angel Reese is being traded to the Atlanta Dream. The Dream are trading a 2027 first-round pick and 2028 first-round pick to the Chicago Sky for the two-time All-Star and 2028 second-round swap rights, sources tell @kendra__andrews.\n\nPrime Video first reported that the teams agreed to a trade involving Reese.\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/espn/status/2041179324078809250#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2042253691059573159",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-09T14:49:57+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is embarrassing, however\u2026 \n\nNASA\u2019s Artemis launch: $4B\nCalifornia bullet train: $126B\n\nMeanwhile, Musk launches SpaceX rockets for roughly $70M.\n\nGovernment builds cost billions.\nEntrepreneurs figure out how to do it for millions.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2041887559391834580",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:35:05+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Your kids need you.\nYour wife needs you.\nYour business needs you.\n\nAnd somehow you still show up.\n\nNo excuses. No spotlight. No complaints.\n\nRespect to the men who are grateful &amp; carry the load without complaining.\n\n\ud83e\udee1",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2041819645544468810",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T10:05:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The more she speaks, the more it hurts Newsome\u2019s chances in 2028.\n\nRepublicans should want her speaking everyday.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2041654289936830901",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-07T23:08:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Ceasefires succeed when they\u2019re part of a structured path to peace, not just a timeout.\n\nWho\u2019s convinced anyone will commit to a cease fire? \n\nThere\u2019s zero trust by either party.\n\nNot sure how long this\u2019ll last even though markets are reacting positively after hours.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2041652768742510673",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-07T23:02:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Grateful for faith, family, and the reminder that new life is always possible.\n\nHe is risen. Happy Easter.\ud83d\udc23\u271d\ufe0f",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2040858728702869529",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-05T18:26:52+00:00",
